  - Id: 903
    Clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93f2b6d5a9f016b48a9d4938b961f6ea, type: 3}
    Captions:
    - At: 0.5
      Seconds: 11
      Text: The following message is transmitted at the request of the Indianapolis
        State Police Department.
    - At: 18
      Seconds: 6
      Text: At 2:35 PM, reports from these counties have issued an outbreak of a
        highly contagious virus.
    - At: 24
      Seconds: 5
      Text: Some reports claim the outbreak started in two county hospitals.
    - At: 29
      Seconds: 8
      Text: Symptoms of this virus include loss of coordination, confusion, and eventually,
        certain death.
    - At: 37
      Seconds: 5
      Text: Reports have also claimed that those infected have acted out in extremely
        violent behavior.
    - At: 42
      Seconds: 4
      Text: Citizens are strongly advised to avoid anyone with these symptoms.
    - At: 46
      Seconds: 5
      Text: At this time, these counties are under quarantine until further notice.
    - At: 51
      Seconds: 7
      Text: As a safety precaution, citizens in nearby counties are advised to stay
        in their homes until the situation is dealt with.
    - At: 58
      Seconds: 3.5
      Text: Stay tuned for further details as they follow.
  - Id: 904
    Clips:
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 357291c7b93d3564fa87eeb79273d63a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ecc57e14fa8fda40ab90cc279e8ae7d, type: 3}
    Captions: []
